            "heading": "Test CA, CS, CMA",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Test CA, CS, CMA only if you can accept long exam cycles."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Explore business, finance, marketing, and analytics with mini projects."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Build English communication, Excel, and AI literacy now."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Do not commit to a loan-heavy degree before you have clarity."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 3
          },
          {
            "needId": "checklist:4",
            "type": "checklist",
            "heading": "Career Options in Andhra Pradesh and Telangana",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Strong for CA, CS and CMA foundation routes and for BCom (general or computers)."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Business analytics and finance roles need Excel and statistics learned on the side."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Rated Scalable with a business layer when you add a niche: tax advisory, bookkeeping for small firms, or analytics."
